OL,3,GNEWSAHuge wallpaper artwork on display
OL,4,Ain Aberdeen's art deco swimming pool
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust weeks after being used as a
OL,7,Ffilming set for Netflix series Dept Q,
OL,8,Fthe Bon Accord Baths in Aberdeen is
OL,9,Fopening its doors to the public to show
OL,10,Fa large-scale art installation.
OL,12,F'Divers', by Tod Hanson, was painted in
OL,13,Fthe artist's small London studio on
OL,14,Frolls of wallpaper - the parts were
OL,15,Fthen assembled and taped to the pool
OL,16,Ffloor.
OL,18,FLocals will be able to visit the art
OL,19,Fdeco venue and see the temporary
OL,20,Finstallation during the first three
OL,21,Fweekends of September.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
